{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>Breaks.</b> From the root of תרועם (Psalms 2:9). This form is well-known in Aramaic." "<b>The earth is broken.</b> In the sense of שבר, as in שלו הייתי ויפרפרני (Job 14:12), and likewise אתה פוררת בעזך ים (Psalms 74:13)."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:55:00.457945627Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}